==Battleground==
*3 [[Pigeon de Sable]]s spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 12~18.67 seconds<sup>360f~560f</sup>.
*2 [[Pigeon de Sable]]s spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 8~8.67 seconds<sup>240f~260f</sup>.
*2 [[Pigeon de Sable]]s spawn after 20.33 seconds<sup>610f</sup>, delay 8.33~9 seconds<sup>250f~270f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Pigeon de Sable]] spawns.
**2 [[Pigeon de Sable]]s spawn, delay 8~10 seconds<sup>240f~300f</sup>.
**1 [[Pigeon de Sable]] spawns.
**1 [[Elizabeth the LVIth]] spawns.
*When the base reaches 98% HP:
**2 [[Pigeon de Sable]]s spawn, delay 8~10 seconds<sup>240f~300f</sup>.
**1 [[Pigeon de Sable]] spawns.
**2 [[Kory|Kories]] spawn, delay 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 97% HP:
**3 [[Pigeon de Sable]]s spawn, delay 8~10 seconds<sup>240f~300f</sup>.
**1 [[Pigeon de Sable]] spawns.
**1 [[Berserkory]] spawns.
*When the base reaches 96% HP:
**3 [[Pigeon de Sable]]s spawn, delay 8~10 seconds<sup>240f~300f</sup>.
**1 [[Pigeon de Sable]] spawns.
**1 [[Dober P.D]] spawns.
*When the base reaches 95% HP:
**1 [[Pigeon de Sable]] spawns as the boss.
**9 [[Pigeon de Sable]]s spawn, delay 8~10 seconds<sup>240f~300f</sup>.
**2 [[Two Can]]s spawn, delay 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Because of the nature of the boss waves, it's a good idea to damage the base with fast attackers that have low damage. This way, the bosses will come out one-at-a-time instead of coming out all at once. This will make the stage much more manageable. Unless they are Immune to Waves, meatshields won't help here because they'll just be wiped off the stage near-instantly. Instead, use high-health units with very few knockbacks and high damage, such as [[Titan Cat (Normal Cat)|Jamiera Cat]], [[Fish Cat (Normal Cat)|Island Cat]], and [[Lizard Cat (Normal Cat)|King Dragon Cat]]. These cats will also be able to quickly kill the Pigeons. [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Awakened Bahamut Cat]] can be useful for dealing devastating damage to the bosses, but you'll be taking a risk by using him. Use [[Kotatsu Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Octopus Cat]] or [[Mightycat (Rare Cat)|Supercat]] to support him if possible. If he deals the finishing blow to the boss and proceeds to attack the base, he will likely trigger multiple waves to come out at once. To be safe, only use him on the last wave against the Two Can.

==='''Recommended Ubers'''===
*Ranged [[Wave Shield]]s like [[EVA Unit-00 (Uber Rare Cat)|Eva Unit-00]] and [[Yamii (Uber Rare Cat)|Yaminora]] help drastically simplify the stage by completely ignoring its main gimmick. This allows you to effectively treat it like any other stage.

